{"2013040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "守麥精靈黛芽", "steam_appid": 2013040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><br>&quot;Wheat Fairy of Daya&quot; is a action game,you will be a wheat fairy girl who needs to against all odds to make the wheats grow up.<br>There are more than 16 levels which you need to live under the weather,birds and other more than 5 other fairy bosses' attack.<br>If you survive at the end of each level, you will receive points based on your performance, which will affect the different endings you will end up in.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>more than 6-7 skills you can use!<br></li><li>more than 5 bosses you can challenge!<br></li><li>Sunny,Rainy,and more other weather exprience!<br></li><li>Get Special CG Arts in different endings!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2>After charging the accumulated energy, click on the target that harms the wheat field to shoot.<br>There will also be many attacks on you in the wheat fields.<br>Be careful to press &quot;avoid&quot; and seize the moment to press &quot;charge up&quot; to knock down the target!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/3a2f6d60e1c7104564c2e0ed3e4d183f.poster.avif?t=1740735927\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/3a2f6d60e1c7104564c2e0ed3e4d183f.webm?t=1740735927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/3a2f6d60e1c7104564c2e0ed3e4d183f.mp4?t=1740735927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can Absorb various energies from nature to release skills of various attributes!<br>Based on your performance,there have 6 skills you can get!<br>Combine different skills to make your own attack style!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/0c03c4e6feb46c5a0f571bdd23827878.poster.avif?t=1740735927\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/0c03c4e6feb46c5a0f571bdd23827878.webm?t=1740735927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/0c03c4e6feb46c5a0f571bdd23827878.mp4?t=1740735927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><br>&quot;Wheat Fairy of Daya&quot; is a action game,you will be a wheat fairy girl who needs to against all odds to make the wheats grow up.<br>There are more than 16 levels which you need to live under the weather,birds and other more than 5 other fairy bosses' attack.<br>If you survive at the end of each level, you will receive points based on your performance, which will affect the different endings you will end up in.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>more than 6-7 skills you can use!<br></li><li>more than 5 bosses you can challenge!<br></li><li>Sunny,Rainy,and more other weather exprience!<br></li><li>Get Special CG Arts in different endings!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2>After charging the accumulated energy, click on the target that harms the wheat field to shoot.<br>There will also be many attacks on you in the wheat fields.<br>Be careful to press &quot;avoid&quot; and seize the moment to press &quot;charge up&quot; to knock down the target!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013040/extras/3a2f6d60e1c7104564c2e0ed3e4d183f.poster.avif?t=1740735927\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/